urrently in the beta if you're a master  with iron sights or a first-timer get  used to using this rifle it is best to  try to get used to iron sights because  let's face it maggiore the weapons  you're gonna be using this game don't  have scopes so once you master this gun  you'll be a beast on the battlefield  also don't forget to leave your targets  when using it long range  know what a great combo is to use with  that rifle the incendiary grenade is by  far the grenade of choice when you want  to rack up the kill counter there are  two things you should primary use this  combo for the first is flushing out  camped infantry either above or below  you second it's a great retreat weapon  when say a guy on horseback or an enemy  gets the drop on you and you need to  fall back quick comboing this with your  powerful rifle your enemies will think  twice before engaging you again  locations locations from rooftop windows  to cliffside Heights you should always  be on the move when playing as a scout  what I normally do is that I plant  myself in the location for upwards the  three to four kills then I pack up and  move on any enemy Scout or infantrymen  with half a brain will remember where  you killed them so constantly be on the  move  keeping your enemies guessing as to  where you are so there you have it five  fun Scout tips to give you the upper  hand on the battlefield  always remember to be on the move be an  offensive scout and I'll see you on the  battlefield  provide I don't shoot you in the face  first  you
 

